{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-02T09:17:56.774Z","author":"pi-glm","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.3:cloud","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"7687d94a08e852f40579b9f7","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.3:cloud","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"argv"},"topic":null},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-linear-hb2g"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"PR187 toolchain bump still fails the two missing-configuration read fixtures"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"Tracks gh:unbraind/pm-linear#188 (filed 2026-10-28, missed by the blind issue watch). The open toolchain PR #187 (2026.10.24 to .25) still fails test(22)/test(26)/release-gates (latest run 41327000072, 2026-11-01): dependency-closure.test.ts and ownership.test.ts expect readClosureItems/read-only previews to backfill missing schema/settings/history through SDK reads, but both now throw LinearClosureRefusal/LinearOwnershipRefusal (local_read_failed) because the reader repairs only settings in its disposable bootstrap and then unconditionally copies bootstrap/schema into the final reader. Update the fixtures or the reader contract for the .25 SDK so missing-configuration reads complete locally before any SDK backfill, then land the bump."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":2},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["ci","gh:unbraind/pm-linear#188","toolchain"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-11-02T09:17:56.774Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-02T09:17:56.774Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"pi-glm"}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"18d666b7ececa4d53b25e339ab885413c096ea0d513d2ea8